{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-02-02 10:18:00', 'title': "AEP HONORED AS ONE OF FORTUNE'S WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES FOR NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR", 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO, FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) WAS INCLUDED IN FORTUNE MAGAZINE'S 2022 WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES LIST, WHICH EVALUATES COMPANIES' FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE AND CORPORATE REPUTATION. THIS IS THE NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR THE COMPANY IS BEING RECOGNIZED IN THE LIST'S ELECTRIC AND GAS UTILITIES SECTOR."}